<div id="urduTextPath">(ص) أم البنين/أم البنين مادرِ عباس ذی وقار</div>

Ummul baneen maadare abbase zi weqaar<br>
Rehlat pe teri aale mohammed hai ashkbaar<br>
Mazloomiyat pe teri hai sab ke jigar figaar<br>
Sajjad kar rahe hai yahi bain baar baar<br>
<br>
Sadme uthaa utha ke jahaa'n se guzar gayi<br>
Peeto sarou ko maadare abbas margayi<br>
<br>
Baade batool tu ne sambhala ali ka ghar<br>
Bachou pe fatima ke shafaqat se ki nazar<br>
Kulsoom se rahi nahi ek pal bhi be qabar<br>
Mashghool thi jo qidmat e zainab me sar basar<br>
<br>
Wo jaa'n nisaar e zainab e bepar nahi rahi<br>
Wo sogwaar e sibte payambar nahi rahi<br>
<br>
Sar par ali ke zaqm laga jiske saamne<br>
Tukde jigar hassan ka huwa jiske saamne<br>
Shabbir se madina chuta jiske saamne<br>
Ghar fatima ka loota gaya jiske saamne<br>
<br>
Roti rahi jo fatima ke noore ain par<br>
Jis ne nisar kar diye bete hussain par<br>
<br>
Jis dam safar madine se shabbir ne kiya<br>
Bibi ne chaar betou ko bhi sath kar diya<br>
Abbas e naamdaar se phir roke ye kaha<br>
Shabbir ko hisaar me apne rakho sada<br>
<br>
Baandho kamar hifazat e sibte rasool par<br>
Aane na paaye dhoop bhi jaan e batool par<br>
<br>
Gar koi zaqm aayega jism e rasool par<br>
Mai muh dikha sakoongi na zehra ko ek nazar<br>
Zainab se aur hussain se ghaafil huwe agar<br>
Baqshungi mai na doodh ye sun lo mere pisar<br>
<br>
Chidne se pehle mashk ke shaane kataao tum<br>
Gar mashk chid gayi to palat kar na aao tum<br>
<br>
Jab karbala se sheh ki sawaari chali gayi<br>
Weeraa'n madina hogaya sughra ujad gayi<br>
Sughra ke paas reh gayi ummul baneen bhi<br>
Beemar e gham ke jeene ki umeed jo na thi<br>
<br>
Pesh e nazar jo haq e imaame anaam tha<br>
Ummul banee'n ko qidmat e sughra se kaam tha<br>
<br>
Jab lut ke aaya qafila e shaahe tashnakaam<br>
Us waqt ye shabbir se kehne lage imaam<br>
Jaakar madine me ye qabar kar ba ehtemaam<br>
Aaye hai qaidi shaam se chutkar haram tamam<br>
<br>
Karbobala me lut gaya sab ghar imaam ka<br>
Sar kat gaya hussain alaihissalaam ka<br>
<br>
Jis dam sunaani aake sunayi basheer ne<br>
Cheda dilou ko barchi ne gardan ko teer ne<br>
Girya kiya har ek sagheer o kabeer ne<br>
Pucha ye aake zouj e janabe ameer ne<br>
<br>
Jab qatl fatima ke pisar ka huwa bata<br>
Abbas mera zinda tha us waqt kya bata<br>
<br>
Rokar basheer kehne laga tab ba shor o shain<br>
Abbas pehle qatl huwe baad me hussain<br>
Kaata hai shimr ne sar e sultaane mashraqain<br>
Loota hai zalimo ne dil e fatima ka chain<br>
<br>
Ghazi ke baad lut gaya sab ghar batool ka<br>
Haami koi raha nahi sibte rasool ka<br>
<br>
Ummul banee'n ka marsiya is dam padho hassan<br>
Aansoo bahao ankhou se matam karo hassan<br>
Ghar fatima ka lut gaya ro kar kaho hassan<br>
Pursa do maa ko hazrate abbas ka hassan<br>
<br>
Ummul banee'n ke gham me sabhi sogwaar hai<br>
Marqad me apne phir se ali beqarar hai